    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "a18",
      "style": "normal",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "ay",
          "text": "If Muhammad came back to this world, the “Muslims” would stone him to death. The religion they follow today has nothing to do with the Islam, i.e., Submission, preached by Abraham and Muhammad. Everything the “Muslims” do is wrong: the First Pillar (Shahaadah), the call to Salat prayer (Azan), the ablution (Wudu), the daily Salat prayers, the Zakat charity, Hajj, and all other practices of Islam (see "
        },
